.el .ds Aq '
.TH bap-install 1  "bap-install " 
.SH NAME
bap\-install \- Install packages into node_modules (reads package.json with no specs)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-install\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISPECS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install packages into node_modules (reads package.json with no specs)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISPECS\fR]
package specs (name or name@range)
